      "description": "Singleton replacement",
      "first_seen": "2026-09-19",
      "last_seen": "2026-09-19",
      "assessment": {
        "validity": "argued",
        "validity_reason": "Every original singleton occurrence is replaced. An output occurrence must be inserted by a replacement, which requires both a source match and an occurrence in the replacement.",
        "availability": "source-gap-candidate",
        "availability_reason": "The audited RARE and rewriteContains/rewriteReplaceAll paths lack this composition; related single-replacement rules exist.",
        "value": "unmeasured",
        "value_reason": "Empty replacement makes the containment assertion false; prefix variants need additional reasoning."
      },
      "candidate": "M-1",
      "cautions": [
        "The issue proposal omits source containment: s=[], u=[0], r=[0] makes its LHS false and RHS true.",
        "Do not generalize to longer needles: deleting ab from aabb creates ab across a boundary.",
        "The nonempty-replacement RHS adds containment work."
      ],
      "checks": {
        "rare_syntax": "passed",
